---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use | Toile Blanche | Saint-Paul de Vence"
  description="Terms and conditions governing access to and use of Toile Blanche services."
>
  <Nav theme="light" />

  <main>
    <section class="info-header">
      <div class="info-header-inner">
        <p class="info-eyebrow">Legal</p>
        <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="info-body">
      <div class="info-body-inner">
        <p>By accessing or using our services, you agree to be bound by the following terms and conditions. If you do not agree, you may not access or use our services.</p>

        <h2>Use of Services</h2>
        <p>Our services are intended for individuals 18 years of age or older. By using our services, you represent and warrant that you meet this requirement.</p>

        <h2>Reservations &amp; Payment</h2>
        <p>To make a reservation, you must provide valid payment information and comply with any requirements we may impose. We reserve the right to cancel or modify reservations where fraudulent or inappropriate activity is suspected, or where a reservation contains or resulted from an error.</p>

        <h2>Cancellation &amp; Refunds</h2>
        <p>You may cancel your reservation at any time, subject to the cancellation fees outlined in our <a href="/booking-conditions">booking conditions</a>.</p>

        <h2>Hotel Policies</h2>
        <p>You must comply with all hotel policies, including check-in/check-out times, pet policies, and smoking policies. We reserve the right to ask you to leave the property if any policy is violated.</p>

        <h2>Prohibited Activities</h2>
        <p>You may not engage in any illegal, harmful, or offensive activities while using our services or staying at the property.</p>

        <h2>Indemnification</h2>
        <p>You agree to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless Toile Blanche, its officers, directors, employees, agents, licensors, and suppliers from and against all losses, expenses, damages, and costs — including reasonable legal fees — resulting from any violation of these terms or activity related to your use of our services.</p>

        <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>Our services are provided "as is" and "as available." We disclaim any warranties, express or implied, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement. We do not warrant uninterrupted, secure, or error-free availability of our services.</p>

        <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>In no event shall Toile Blanche be liable for any direct, indirect, punitive, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising out of or connected with the use of our services, whether based on contract, tort, negligence, strict liability, or otherwise.</p>

        <h2>Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by French law. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the commercial tribunal of Nice.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  @import '/css/info-page.css';
</style>
